# Local SQLite databases (Prototype 1 SQLite verification flow).
# The active runtime database lives at data/prototype_1/watchtower.sqlite.
# Keep these files out of the repo so committed schema/code changes are
# never confused with locally generated row data.
data/*.sqlite
data/**/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite-journal
data/**/*.sqlite-journal
data/*.sqlite-wal
data/**/*.sqlite-wal
data/*.sqlite-shm
